    "detailed_description": "&quot;Captivate players with non-scrolling single-screen combat, flashy support attacks with armaments, and beautiful 3D graphics. Don't miss the new sensation twin-stick shooter &quot;XALADIA&quot;!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/2d4fa08dbe8825649438b6912b101576.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/2d4fa08dbe8825649438b6912b101576.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/2d4fa08dbe8825649438b6912b101576.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Setting</h2>As an elite special forces soldier of the planetary exploration team, you have traveled to numerous planets for survey missions and colonization throughout the galaxy. <br>However, suddenly an enemy appears to obstruct your mission. <br>The massive force, which covers the entire universe, turns out to be highly aggressive alien space pirates.<br><br>Headquarters issues an order to you, who is determined to fight to protect the planets: &quot;While supporting planetary colonization, exterminate the enemy and return to Earth (base).&quot; <br>In the year 21XX, the long struggle for cosmic supremacy between humanity and the space pirates begins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of XALADIA</h2>\u30fbNon-scrolling single-screen combat<br><br>\u30fbFlashy support attacks with various armaments<br>\u30fbBeautiful 3D graphics<br>\u30fbUpgrading abilities of soldiers, firearms, and craft weapons<br>\u30fbStage generation system that changes the appearance pattern of planets and enemies every time you play<br>\u30fbShooting game that incorporates retro feeling with modern visuals and systems<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Non-Scrolling Single-Screen Combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/6add5e0245a78f6ef9d125fb2c637e3f.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/6add5e0245a78f6ef9d125fb2c637e3f.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/6add5e0245a78f6ef9d125fb2c637e3f.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Combat takes place on a single screen, and players fight against aliens while freely moving around the screen. As the combat becomes more intense on the screen, the sense of speed and presence increases.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flashy Support Attacks with Armaments</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/3140396bbd8ec481c6997a246434fd8b.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/3140396bbd8ec481c6997a246434fd8b.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/3140396bbd8ec481c6997a246434fd8b.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In addition to the weapons that the player is equipped with, there are armaments that provide support attacks. By installing multiple armaments, the attacks against the aliens become more flashy. Different attacks are possible depending on the type and performance of the armaments, and the scene of explosions, lasers, missiles, etc. flying all over the screen is characteristic.<br><br>There are also elements that allow you to sweep the enemies in a satisfying way by raising your own ability values and weapon ability values. This allows you to enjoy more efficient and smooth gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful 3D Graphics</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/a517a17d09b3e508e2ca8b9aa7466a92.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/a517a17d09b3e508e2ca8b9aa7466a92.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/a517a17d09b3e508e2ca8b9aa7466a92.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The graphics, which are finely crafted down to the details such as background with depth, lighting, and effects, have become beautiful and powerful visuals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>XALADIA is the first self-published release from the developers of Tenchu, Way of the Samurai, AKIBA\u2019S TRIP, and the Octopath Traveler series.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Captivate players with non-scrolling single-screen combat, flashy support attacks with armaments, and beautiful 3D graphics. Don't miss the new sensation twin-stick shooter &quot;XALADIA&quot;!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/2d4fa08dbe8825649438b6912b101576.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/2d4fa08dbe8825649438b6912b101576.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/2d4fa08dbe8825649438b6912b101576.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Setting</h2>As an elite special forces soldier of the planetary exploration team, you have traveled to numerous planets for survey missions and colonization throughout the galaxy. <br>However, suddenly an enemy appears to obstruct your mission. <br>The massive force, which covers the entire universe, turns out to be highly aggressive alien space pirates.<br><br>Headquarters issues an order to you, who is determined to fight to protect the planets: &quot;While supporting planetary colonization, exterminate the enemy and return to Earth (base).&quot; <br>In the year 21XX, the long struggle for cosmic supremacy between humanity and the space pirates begins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of XALADIA</h2>\u30fbNon-scrolling single-screen combat<br><br>\u30fbFlashy support attacks with various armaments<br>\u30fbBeautiful 3D graphics<br>\u30fbUpgrading abilities of soldiers, firearms, and craft weapons<br>\u30fbStage generation system that changes the appearance pattern of planets and enemies every time you play<br>\u30fbShooting game that incorporates retro feeling with modern visuals and systems<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Non-Scrolling Single-Screen Combat</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/6add5e0245a78f6ef9d125fb2c637e3f.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/6add5e0245a78f6ef9d125fb2c637e3f.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/6add5e0245a78f6ef9d125fb2c637e3f.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Combat takes place on a single screen, and players fight against aliens while freely moving around the screen. As the combat becomes more intense on the screen, the sense of speed and presence increases.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flashy Support Attacks with Armaments</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/3140396bbd8ec481c6997a246434fd8b.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/3140396bbd8ec481c6997a246434fd8b.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/3140396bbd8ec481c6997a246434fd8b.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>In addition to the weapons that the player is equipped with, there are armaments that provide support attacks. By installing multiple armaments, the attacks against the aliens become more flashy. Different attacks are possible depending on the type and performance of the armaments, and the scene of explosions, lasers, missiles, etc. flying all over the screen is characteristic.<br><br>There are also elements that allow you to sweep the enemies in a satisfying way by raising your own ability values and weapon ability values. This allows you to enjoy more efficient and smooth gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful 3D Graphics</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/a517a17d09b3e508e2ca8b9aa7466a92.poster.avif?t=1734325132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/a517a17d09b3e508e2ca8b9aa7466a92.webm?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2218190/extras/a517a17d09b3e508e2ca8b9aa7466a92.mp4?t=1734325132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The graphics, which are finely crafted down to the details such as background with depth, lighting, and effects, have become beautiful and powerful visuals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>XALADIA is the first self-published release from the developers of Tenchu, Way of the Samurai, AKIBA\u2019S TRIP, and the Octopath Traveler series.</strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Face cosmic threats in &quot;XALADIA&quot;, the ultimate twin-stick shooter! Conquer the battlefield with stunning 3D graphics and evolving combat. Use missiles, lasers, barriers to decimate space pirates. Upgrade weapons, unleash a relentless barrage. Experience the real space warfare!",
